# "Mill four cards. When you do, ..." triggers only if four cards were milled (CR 603.12): with a library of three
# cards, Hired Blade (a legal target) among them, Bot1 mills all three (CR 701.17b) and the reflexive ability never
# goes on the stack, so the Blade stays in the graveyard (ruling for the same template, Wick's Patrol, 2024-07-26).
# Positive control: yathan-roadwatcher-mills-four-then-returns-a-three-drop-of-yours-only.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Yathan Roadwatcher
Island
Island
Hired Blade
Island
Island

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x30

[Actions]
[Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Yathan Roadwatcher.Cast
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Library.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 3
Bot1.Graveyard.Hired Blade.Power = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 5
Stack.Count = 0
